new file mode 100644
index 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..dc6eef840438905c9dccdc2ad069c29e332412f7
--- /dev/null
+++ b/core/pq_native.md
@@ -0,0 +1,42 @@
+# Native root Succinct research verifier
+
+This is an isolated research backend, not a production verifier or a P1/P2,
+hiding, or post-quantum-security acceptance claim.
+
+The genesis configuration selects `backend: risc0-succinct-native-v1` and
+`nativeAlgorithmDigest: 0x0675a90a342d394bf8b6b98f9df5e880d41fe6c6b0f605a800c33ba784ce09a2`.
+That SHA-256 binds the delivered Rust `ALGORITHM.txt`, including RISC Zero
+3.0.5, canonical bounded bincode Receipt encoding, a single Succinct receipt,
+Poseidon2, the default fixed recursion control root and verifier parameters,
+the fixed migration ImageID, Halted(0), no unresolved assumptions, and exact
+198-byte journal equality. The Rust static library implements those rules.
+A platform binary hash is retained only as measurement provenance; it is
+not substituted for the algorithm declaration.
+
+The same migration PI and version 0x80000002 are preserved for this compression
+experiment. A fresh isolated genesis explicitly selects the new algorithm;
+this is not an in-place production verifier-version replacement. Configuration
+compatibility checks reject changes to the pinned PQ configuration on restart.
+
+Build with CGO_ENABLED=1, build tag pq_native, and CGO_LDFLAGS pointing at the
+directory containing libpq_succinct_native.a. Linkage names the .a file
+explicitly, so a neighbouring .so cannot be silently preferred. Geth startup,
+pool cryptographic validation, and block execution call the C ABI in the same
+process. There is no worker fallback for this backend. A build without CGO or
+the tag reports PQ_FULL_VERIFIER_UNAVAILABLE and does not classify the proof
+as cryptographically invalid.
+
+The 0x7e transaction has no EIP-7825 exemption: cheap admission, stateful
+validation/execution and miner selection all apply params.MaxTxGas (16777216).
+A research TxGasCap may only further restrict that limit. The 512-KiB receipt
+bound and 768-KiB carrier bound do not promise that every allowed-size byte
+string fits within the gas limit; intrinsic gas and the data floor still apply.
+VerifyGas=5500000 is the unchanged provisional experiment constant.
+
+The historical Composite worker backend has been removed. Empty backend
+selection is rejected. Its archived regression source is retained under the
+explicit `pq_historical` test tag; enabling that tag does not restore the old
+backend or establish current native execution coverage.
+Positive/negative proof-cache keys bind backend and algorithm declaration,
+as well as every PI byte, proof hash and other pinned identities. State, nonce,
+balance, fee, expiry and sponsor checks remain outside those caches.
